{"id":"monto_n","lemma":"montón","pos":"noun","rank":541,"glosses":["heap, pile (collection of things laid in a body, or thrown together so as to form an elevation)","ton, a lot, bunch, heap, loads (a great deal; a great quantity)"],"ipa":"/monˈton/","gender":"m","forms":{"plural":"montones"},"audio":"https://upload.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/d/d2/LL-Q1321_%28spa%29-Marreromarco-mont%C3%B3n.wav","examples":[{"text":"¡Es un montón!","en":"That's a lot!","audio":"https://tatoeba.org/en/audio/download/438439","words":[{"g":"to be","l":"ser"},{"g":"a"},null]},{"text":"Tengo montones de dinero.","en":"I have a ton of money.","audio":"https://tatoeba.org/en/audio/download/630309","words":[{"g":"to have","l":"tener"},null,{"g":"of / from"},{"g":"money"}]},{"text":"Te perdiste un montón.","en":"You missed a lot.","audio":"https://tatoeba.org/en/audio/download/443411","words":[{"g":"you"},{"g":"to lose","l":"perder"},{"g":"a"},null]},{"text":"Parece haber montones y montones de estrellas.","en":"There seem to be lots and lots of stars.","audio":"https://tatoeba.org/en/audio/download/703988","words":[{"g":"to seem, to see fit","l":"parecer"},{"g":"to have"},null,{"g":"and"},null,{"g":"of / from"},{"g":"star","l":"estrella"}]},{"text":"Mi padre tiene un montón de libros.","en":"My dad owns a lot of books.","audio":"https://tatoeba.org/en/audio/download/639420","words":[{"g":"my"},{"g":"father, parent"},{"g":"to have","l":"tener"},{"g":"a"},null,{"g":"of / from"},{"g":"book","l":"libro"}]}]}